      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "What you've closed is not actually EAC, but rather a simple process that watches for vrchat to shut down and in turn, shuts down the rest of EAC. \n\nClosing this program will have absolutely no benefit, and on the contrary you will notice that when you close vrchat, steam will not recognize that it has closed because it still has the EAC sub-process running.\n\nDoing this will just make things more annoying for you when dealing with steam, nothing more.",
